This repository also contains material made from ROS 2 message and service
definitions, which are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(data/msgs/LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt):

- tools/ros2_jazzy/: the .msg / .srv definitions as distributed with ROS 2
  Jazzy (/opt/ros/jazzy/share/<package>/), unchanged, and type_hashes.txt,
  the type hashes from the type description JSON files of the same
  packages.
- data/msgs/: Ruby files generated from those definitions by
  tools/asterism_msggen.rb (each file names the definition it was made
  from).
- test/msgs/golden_cdr.tsv and test/msgs/test_type_hashes.txt: values
  computed by ROS 2's tools (rclpy, rosidl) in a ROS 2 Jazzy image.

The ROS 2 packages these come from, all "Apache License 2.0" in their
package.xml:

- std_msgs, geometry_msgs, sensor_msgs (ros2/common_interfaces)
- builtin_interfaces, service_msgs (ros2/rcl_interfaces)
- example_interfaces (ros2/example_interfaces)

Copyright in the definitions belongs to their authors (Open Source Robotics
Foundation, Inc. and the ROS 2 contributors); see those repositories.
